From: Sungsu Ahn <sungsu_ahn@korea.ac.kr>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:18:07 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 19/51] diag: per-thread event ring (writes with locked
 record/stale flag, RO->RW promotions, reclaims) and torn-value source
 decoding

MEGALON_DIAG=1 only. Each Put records (key, record locked by write_seq_start, stale/owner flags, low 32
bits of the value stamp); SwitchRW records the promotion; every reclaim records the victim record and
the record the RO switch returned. kv-store dumps the rings to <result>/diag-ring.bin and, on a failed
value check, names the stamp each word of the torn value came from (mix64 is inverted).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
